            <ArticleTitle>ADHD: Overdiagnosed and overtreated, or misdiagnosed and mistreated?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>873-880</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3949/ccjm.84a.15051</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In today's changing medical climate, physicians need to treat attention-deficit/hyperactivity disorder (ADHD) better and more cost-effectively. The authors review recommendations supported by recent research and offer simple practices that integrate medicine and behavioral health for patients with ADHD.</AbstractText>
